[0.032, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29AI have built the electronics parts tracker app and launched an iOS simulator build to verify compilation. Waiting\r\n  for the build to finish...\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 18.7s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Project build completed successfully for iOS. Thoroughly verifying the `pubspec.yaml` dependen...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(implementation_plan.md)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  The Flutter iOS electronics parts tracking application has been implemented and verified.\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m### Key Deliverables\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mData Layer & SQLite Storage\u001b[m:\r\n      • \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jka9f7a49b3e95e8a9;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/database/app_database.dart\u0007AppDatabase\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Local SQLite database managing \u001b[94mparts\u001b[m and \u001b[94mstorage_locations\u001b[m tables, indexed queries, and starter\r\n\u001b[6Ccomponent seeding.\u001b[K\n\u001b[18D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkcd2e0a2d7f23f8db;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib"]
[0.000, "o", "/data/repositories/parts_repository.dart\u0007PartsRepository\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: CRUD operations, real-time inventory statistics, search, and stock adjustment logic.\r\n\t\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkb213690a2ad3e0fe;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/repositories/locations_repository.dart\u0007LocationsRepository\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Storage location CRUD and inventory count per container.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mDomain Models\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n      • \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk915c71dfb7634265;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/domain/models/part.dart\u0007Part\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Component data model tracking value, package/footprint, quantity, reorder alert threshold, storage\r\n\u001b[6Clocation, datasheet URL, and photo path.\u001b[K\n\u001b[40D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jka2c92e67a8849d82;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/domain/models/storage_location.dart\u0007StorageLocation\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Physical storage container model (cabinets, drawers, bins, SMD books).\r\n  • \u001b[1mUI & Presentation (M"]
[0.000, "o", "aterial 3)\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n      • \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk4b962e2ee6c4be1e;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/ui/features/inventory/views/inventory_screen.dart\u0007InventoryScreen\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Live search, category chips, stats header (SKUs, units, low-stock), and quick +/- stock\r\n\u001b[6Csteppers on each \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf45c09df9685944a;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/ui/features/inventory/views/part_card.dart\u0007PartCard\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\u001b[K\n\u001b[26D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd6dfed496ff645db;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/ui/features/inventory/views/part_detail_screen.dart\u0007PartDetailScreen\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Detailed specs view, component image viewer, and one-tap datasheet browser launcher.\r\n\t\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk4ba9e474d32d2141;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/ui/features/inventory/views/part_edit_screen.dart\u0007PartEditScreen\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Add/edit screen with iOS camera/photo library atta"]
