[0.034, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A\u001b[K\r\n  I have built the electronics parts tracker app and launched an iOS simulator build to verify compilation. Waiting\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  for the build to finish...\r\n\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 18.7s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Project build completed successfully for iOS. Thoroughly verifying the `pubspec.yaml` dependen...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(implementation_plan.md)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\n  The Flutter iOS electronics parts tracking application has been implemented and verified.\r\n\n  \u001b[1m### Key Deliverables\u001b[m\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mData Layer & SQLite Storage\u001b[m:\n\u001b[26D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk35bb659943b1f35;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/database/app_database.dart\u0007AppDatabase\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Local SQLite database managing \u001b[94mparts\u001b[m and \u001b[94mstorage_locations\u001b[m tables, indexed queries, and starter\r\n\u001b[6Ccomponent seeding.\n\u001b[18D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk73d447487f93f107;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data"]
[0.000, "o", "/repositories/parts_repository.dart\u0007PartsRepository\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: CRUD operations, real-time inventory statistics, search, and stock adjustment logic.\r\n\u001b[6C• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk6e0e33512b4bfd8a;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/repositories/locations_repository.dart\u0007LocationsRepository\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Storage location CRUD and inventory count per container.\r\n  • \u001b[1mDomain Models\u001b[m:\n\u001b[12D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk43d46ffff955bbc1;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/domain/models/part.dart\u0007Part\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Component data model tracking value, package/footprint, quantity, reorder alert threshold, storage\r\n\u001b[6Clocation, datasheet URL, and photo path.\n\u001b[40D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkcd203a49ee7f9566;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/domain/models/storage_location.dart\u0007StorageLocation\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Physical storage container model (cabinets, drawers, bins, SMD books).\r\n  • \u001b[1mUI & Presentation (Material 3"]
