[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29AThe Flutter iOS electronics parts tracking application has been implemented and verified.\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m### Key Deliverables\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mData Layer & SQLite Storage\u001b[m:\r\n      • \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk15c00f420befa7a1;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/database/app_database.dart\u0007AppDatabase\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Local SQLite database managing \u001b[94mparts\u001b[m and \u001b[94mstorage_locations\u001b[m tables, indexed queries, and starter\r\n\u001b[6Ccomponent seeding.\u001b[K\n\u001b[18D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk52550fb7b7a18373;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/repositories/parts_repository.dart\u0007PartsRepository\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: CRUD operations, real-time inventory statistics, search, and stock adjustment logic.\r\n\t\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke9aa2c5888f87e46;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/repositories/locations_repository.dart\u0007LocationsRepository\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Storage location CRUD and inventory count per container.\u001b[K\r\n  •"]
